    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.poster.avif?t=1754066488\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.webm?t=1754066488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.mp4?t=1754066488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to Shadowbox Roulette!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind game of <strong>ragebaiting</strong>, deception, reflexes, and sheer luck? Face off in a tense <strong>1v1</strong> where reading your opponent is the key to survival. But! Losing the <strong>shadowbox</strong> means stepping into <strong>Russian Roulette</strong>, where fates decides your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/196adbc80e8ab95ca2fd0e643f8f1acb.avif?t=1754066488\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically <strong>shadowboxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to <strong>match the direction with their opponent</strong> either <strong>3</strong> times in a row or just <strong>once</strong>. Each successful match allows the player to fire a roulette shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Given a lot of freedom, players can actually do whatever they want.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.poster.avif?t=1754066488\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.webm?t=1754066488\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/599c8d4551e7945c72a95dd86da85871.mp4?t=1754066488\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to Shadowbox Roulette!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mind game of <strong>ragebaiting</strong>, deception, reflexes, and sheer luck? Face off in a tense <strong>1v1</strong> where reading your opponent is the key to survival. But! Losing the <strong>shadowbox</strong> means stepping into <strong>Russian Roulette</strong>, where fates decides your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122050/extras/196adbc80e8ab95ca2fd0e643f8f1acb.avif?t=1754066488\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically <strong>shadowboxing.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players try to <strong>match the direction with their opponent</strong> either <strong>3</strong> times in a row or just <strong>once</strong>. Each successful match allows the player to fire a roulette shot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Given a lot of freedom, players can actually do whatever they want.</strong>\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Play in a short and silly yet tense 1v1 ragebait shadowboxing duel. Celebrate your victory with hilarious emotes and show off your triumph! Outsmart, outplay, or risk it all-will you survive the gamble?",
